fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstutils.html#gst_util_floor_log2","fragment":"\n\tgst_util_floor_log2\n\n\n\tGst.prototype.util_floor_log2\n\n\n\tGst.util_floor_log2\n\nReturns smallest integral value not bigger than log2(v).\nParameters:\na guint32 value.\na computed guint val.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nReturns smallest integral value not bigger than log2(v).\nParameters:\na Number value.\na computed Number val.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nReturns smallest integral value not bigger than log2(v).\nParameters:\na int value.\na computed int val.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});